==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{l|ru|не}} + {{term|делать|делая|no working|lang=ru|sc=Cyrl}}, originally used to mean Sunday, the day of rest (Old Church Slavonic {{term|недѣля|sc=Cyrs||not doing|lang=cu}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/nʲɪˈdʲelʲə/|lang=ru}}
* {{audio|Ru-неделя.ogg|audio}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun|tr=nedélja|g=f}}

# [[week]]
#:* {{l|ru|в}} неделю — ''per week''
#:* {{l|ru|на}} [[прошлый|прошлой]] неделе — ''last week''
#:* на [[этот|этой]] неделе — ''this week''
#:* на [[будущий|будущей]] неделе — ''next week''

====Declension====
